byte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [[DB-438]](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-438)\r\nTracker task for hardening tablet splitting. The current release timelines for turning tablet splitting on are\r\n- for latest releases, we will enable it starting in 2.11.0\r\n- for stable releases, we will enable it in some future version of 2.8.x\r\n\r\n# Known issues (timeline 2.8.x)\r\n✅ Very large txns (50k+) could be lost if splitting during apply phase (#10162)\r\n✅ Issues with manual splitting (#10347)\r\n✅ Issues with YSQL ALTER TABLE (#10351)\r\n⬜️ Log spew on intent cleanup if compactions take too long (#10154)\r\n\r\n# Production readiness (timeline 2.8.x)\r\n⬜️ Admin UI to monitor split progress (#8197)\r\n✅ Display split depth in master UI (#10435)\r\n✅ Factor in blacklist for full moves (#8198)\r\n✅ Threshold math should only work off of nodes in the table's placement (#8660)\r\n✅ Split selection algorithm should prioritize by tablet size (#10498)\r\n✅ Investigate if large txn apply records could affect computing split key (#10163)\r\n✅ Disable splitting during backups to prevent transient failures (#8744)\r\n\r\n# Interactions with other features\r\n## Supported features\r\nThese features are well integrated with tablet splitting.\r\n\r\n✅ PITR (#8235)\r\n✅ Index backfill (#6704) -- If a split is in progress, backfill fails. If backfill is in progress, splitting does not get triggered.\r\n✅ Backup restore for YCQL (#6628) and YSQL(#8229)\r\n✅ Geo-partition -- should just work, as partitions are just normal YB tables under the hood\r\n\r\n## Disabled features\r\nTablet splitting is not currently supported for the following and thus sensibly disabled. The behavior would thus be that you can use the respective feature, but tables related to it would not get automatically split.\r\n\r\n✅ YEDIS (#8255)\r\n✅ xcluster replication (#8256)\r\n✅ System transactions table\r\n\r\n## Support (timeline 2.11.x)\r\nThese features do not yet have support for splitting, but we are actively working towards them.\r\n⬜️ xcluster replication (#5373)\r\n⬜️ TTL file expiry (#10515)\r\n⬜️ colocation (#4396)\n\n[DB-438]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-438?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/8242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/8242/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/850793656","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/7213#issuecomment-850793656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/7213","id":850793656,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1MDc5MzY1Ng==","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-05-29T08:18:06Z","updated_at":"2021-05-29T08:18:06Z","body":"Faced another occurrence of this issue.\r\nThere are a lot of\r\n```\r\nW0518 11:48:21.665313 23680 table.cc:347] Error getting table locations: Not found (yb/master/catalog_manager.cc:528): The object 'd82ed09fc9ff41db96e23b312765e285.cassandrauniquesecondaryindex'\r\ndoes not exist, retrying.\r\n...\r\nW0518 11:50:01.718245 23680 table.cc:347] Error getting table locations: Not found (yb/master/catalog_manager.cc:528): The object 'd82ed09fc9ff41db96e23b312765e285.cassandrauniquesecondaryindex'\r\ndoes not exist, retrying.\r\nE0518 11:50:05.538031 23680 table.cc:360] OpenTable timed out\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt tries to get table locations in a loop until timeout. During that time other threads looking for table locations are stuck on a mutex. Then one thread times out and another thread repeats the same thing…\r\n\r\nSo, it is not actually a deadlock, but still, blocking threads waiting for table locations.\r\n\r\nAn old table with this name has been deleted and a new one with the same created, but split was disabled for new one until backfill completed and once split was enabled - it tries to fetch table locations for the old table because old table ID is cached somewhere.\r\n\r\nFetchPartitions should just return that table was deleted without retries in that case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/850793656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4831762600,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQ4MzE3NjI2MDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/4831762600","actor":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusu